    "finalMessage": "The notifications inbox is built in `src/screens/Screen.tsx` with styles in `src/screens/Screen.module.css`. Since I can't run the app, I couldn't visually verify it in a browser — this is based on Syntara MCP docs/audits only.\n\nSummary of what it does:\n- Shows 8 mock notifications grouped under \"Today\" and \"Earlier\" headings, each row using `Card`/`CardContent` with an `IconTile` (type icon), title, unread `Badge`, one-line detail, a type `Badge`, and time.\n- Unread items show an \"Unread\" status badge and a \"Mark as read\" icon button (tooltip-labelled); \"Mark all as read\" sits in the header next to an unread-count badge.\n- A `ToggleButtonGroup` filters by All/Payment/Security/Policy/Reminder, with an `EmptyState` when a filter matches nothing.\n- Layout uses logical properties and `minmax(0, 1fr)` so nothing overflows at 390px; `audit_snippet` scored both files 100 with no findings."
